# --- secrets: never commit these ------------------------------------------
# The upload keystore and its passwords. Losing the keystore means never being
# able to update the app on Play again; leaking it means someone else can ship
# an update as you. Keep the .jks itself OUTSIDE this folder entirely.
android/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

